rp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cda99464-a3c4-43bb-9102-a23d442a6857","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あ、ピンヘッダとコンスルー取り違えてたw\nまあ同じか","ts":"1625139627.486900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c6RZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbc3d19e-30ff-4fa7-bdb7-db33849dff3c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ブレッドボード上でやるとブレッドボードが熱で歪む可能性があるので、ご注意","ts":"1625139608.486800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MLO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff1511f3-4391-4703-82e5-5adcb8677088","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"# OLED用のピンヘッダはさらに浅くて、だいたい自然に取れちゃう","ts":"1625139589.486700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iqz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28a55faa-7380-4833-8c9e-e6a437e5818e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"使えますが、普通のピンヘッダーよりも刺さりが浅いので、その点は気を付けてください。","ts":"1625139562.486200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rMYk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72095d26-fa85-4ea0-ac59-42be34669077","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ただ傾いてはんだづけしてしまうと抜き差ししにくくなる（しかも多ピンを剥がしてはんだづけし直すのはちょっと難しいです）ので、はんだづけするときはブレッドボードに挿した状態か発泡スチロールに刺してやるのがいいですね\nダンボールとかでもいいです","ts":"1625139533.485700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PJ9n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cca102df-685a-419a-bb7e-314f9b8214fc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ピンヘッダもブレッドボードも同じ間隔です","ts":"1625139253.485100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ghER"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d780773-a080-4a6b-ae0f-3a703631db83","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"できますよ","ts":"1625139216.485000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","b